      "writtenOn": "2020-11-30T16:03:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this scenario, is it that we don\u0027t have the sink caps in sink ready, or do we need to process them again when we start up as a sink?  Since they\u0027re stored, I would expect us to only need to re-read the sink capabilities as we start up and there wouldn\u0027t be a need for additional PD traffic.",
      "revId": "ba655d6008da1b2eb943af4f4c52b46c1b0702eb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a2af315f_f77209f4",
